{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-10_beg","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-10","title":"所謂“英雄”","storyCode":"14-11","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"136a56b734e72a15ca503e42335b00cfbb6cea36b720d340604ba10e6d585a75","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"舉目皆是死亡。\n永不停息的廝殺，生命終結生命。屍骸遍布荒野，血液灌溉土地。\n當第一個食腐者從戰場的廢墟上站起時，他明白了自己存在的意義。\n“我是萬物的終點。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g1_originiumcanyon"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“縱貫”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咒言之力如長矛般徑直地沒入食腐者的身軀。\n它生效的速度是如此之快，快到幾乎看不出行進的軌跡，彷彿在這個詞語剛剛從舌尖滾落時，結果就已經發生。\n孽茨雷的胸口出現了一個洞，邊緣整齊而優美。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但他的神情沒有絲毫變化。幾縷枯枝從他的法杖頂端爬下來，伸進他軀幹上的那個洞，飛快地補上了缺失的部分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的字詞殺不死我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼喊我的聲音，遠比你的咒言響亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我已聽見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰死之人的哀歌，正在你的體內奏響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"數千座戰爭祭壇，橫跨整個戰場。\n一切死去的生命所遺留的部分，都正在被祭壇汲取。\n而這份力量的終點，就在Logos眼前。\n最強大的食腐者，也是最恐怖的戰爭祭壇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食腐者見證死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有英勇的戰士，無論是朋友還是仇敵，都會被我們吸納。在這個死與生的循環中，他們將得到銘記與尊重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而懦夫只配化作塵土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，我的敵人——此時此刻，站在我眼前的，究竟是一位年輕的英雄，還是一名卑劣的叛徒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"評判於我，並無意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"字詞的力量，不在此處。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"力量再一次在Logos掌中積聚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"第二道傷口，從肩膀到一側胸膛，橫穿孽茨雷的身體。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咒文並未就此消散，它阻擋著枯枝的靠近，禁止死者的能量填補食腐者的身體。\n布條掀起又落下，遮住了新的傷口，也蓋住了無數舊的瘡疤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在戰場上，“死亡”可以作為食腐者的養料，但女妖同樣可以為“死亡”送行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孽茨雷閣下，從這一刻起，你不再是戰場唯一的主宰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"論咒言的天賦，你確實勝過我認識的所有女妖，包括菈瑪蓮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你既哀悼死者，為何不為他們吟唱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"輓歌並不能真正安撫死者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要戰爭繼續，死者就和生者一樣，不得安息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒謬！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已行至此處——重創變形者，放逐血魔。身為王庭的主人，雙手沾滿王庭的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你竟想說，這一切都來源於，你對戰爭的逃避？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要讓你的叛逆，成為阻擋我的唯一理由？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"食腐者的身形因憤怒而浮起。在他身下，所有的枝條都在瞬間潰散，腐敗的氣息填滿了整個峽谷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女妖的吟唱，依舊不後退半分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g5_furnaceplatform"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g1_originiumcanyon"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾與菈瑪蓮並肩作戰數十年，戰場橫跨城市與荒原。我們一起將維多利亞的甲胄和高盧的火炮在卡茲戴爾城牆下葬送。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也曾與特蕾西婭合力，在同一場戰役中，斬下數千萊塔尼亞術師的頭顱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們都是最出色的戰士，是卡茲戴爾的戰爭英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菈瑪蓮將女妖的未來交予你，特蕾西婭也視你為引以為傲的門徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你卻躲在羅德島，幫助藏匿魔王，又如竊賊般潛入倫蒂尼姆，躲在戰場的夾縫中，四處破壞——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭並不能結束薩卡茲的痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一路走來，只見到所有人正被你們拖入深淵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你們選擇逃避。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很多年前就對特蕾西婭說過，戰爭，避無可避。如果戰場不在倫蒂尼姆，就必然在卡茲戴爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭同意這一點，只是仍寄希望於在爆發前，能找到另外的解法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的選擇導向了一場新的戰爭。魔王之死，則是戰爭的代價與結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我見證了她的死。她值得所有薩卡茲的尊重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了這些軟弱的言辭，你能給薩卡茲帶來什麼？你還想帶來什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"法杖指向地面。\n腐敗的氣息奔湧而出，淹沒了咒言編織的屏障。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“靈幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低吼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"眾魂的哀歌越來越響亮。\n咒言的力量正在減弱。手指和唇舌也傳來陣陣麻痺。\n怒火並不只來自於面前古老的王庭之主。\n還來自……他自己的血。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我告訴過你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g18_originiumcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杜卡雷，我親眼見證……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我的死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和“魔王”都很清楚，你們殺不死我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們讓我前進到了……一個有趣的地方。“歷史之外”，並非空無一物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我依舊在帷幕之後注視著你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們又走了這麼遠，小女妖，你和那個異族的魔王……你們正在尋找我留下的那滴血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“提卡茲之血”……呵，我渴求的純淨之血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們一心認為只要摧毀了它，就能阻止災厄再度來臨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“事實”。摧毀祭壇，暫時停下“苦難搖籃”，讓那些維多利亞的無能之輩活久一些。多麼無趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太過短視愚癡的人，是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經感受到了，不是嗎？你與祭壇有著緊密的聯繫，甚至此時此刻，你都正在使用被祭壇增強過的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從來就不是某一滴血、某一個人的意志喚醒了“苦難搖籃”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“源石”的降臨，是回應了所有薩卡茲的呼喚。活著的，死去的，無一例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……眾魂的呢喃，無處不在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能聽到，亡者的哀嚎不願停息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲從生下來就為過去所束縛，至死也無法得到解脫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在第一次吟唱輓歌的時候，你就已窺見眾魂的存在……我記得菈瑪蓮曾向我們驕傲地描繪過你的天賦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，沒錯，就是這天賦，才埋下了悖逆的種子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你感到痛苦，不只為別人，也為自己。即便你對我所行的道路如此痛恨，也沒忘記替我感到悲哀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你同樣是受縛於過去之人。可悲至極。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此等狂妄的話語……我真該再試著殺了你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可與之相反，我決定祝福你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"屠戮者與被屠戮者……本就都是循環的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之所以會站在這裡，就是因為你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Logos並未聞到任何鮮血的氣息。\n咒文輕而易舉地穿透了血魔大君的身體，只激起了些許漣漪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你的血，依舊與我的輓歌相連。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然……當然。無論你多麼抗拒，你都和我站在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，我們都是王庭之主……都是薩卡茲最古老的血脈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能戰勝我，我理應欣慰。因為你證明了自己比我更強，更有資格背負薩卡茲的命運，引領眾人跟隨你走下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血魔大君笑了起來，轉身往洞窟深處走去。\n他的身影漸漸消失在源石晶簇之間，他的聲音卻彷彿落在Logos耳畔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我將賜福於你，親愛的哀琺尼爾，殺死我之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吸納我的血液，使用我的力量，讓你對我的憎惡，成為你戰鬥下去的養料！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你將代替我前行，代替我見證——薩卡茲復仇的烈焰，未來將會燒至何方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g1_originiumcanyon"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食腐者，血魔，我們都能聽到同樣的哭嚎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的命運陷於循環之中，而我並不例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我亦是我要對抗的那部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的怒火，也正在我的血管與臟腑中灼燒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"所有的字句都化成了火焰，從天而降，點燃了地上的每一顆種子。\n咒文的力量在Logos指尖、唇齒、胸腔燃燒。\n源石晶簇圍著他瘋長，亡者的嚎哭聲也越來越響亮。它們正隨時準備著接納他，吞噬他。\n他不再拒絕血脈之中的力量。血魔將薩卡茲的烈焰引向他，而他擁抱了這把火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“深淵就在身前，我等可用肉身填於深淵，用鮮血燒盡殘垣。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果……焚盡所有腐朽才能換來新生，那我既是烈焰，也是薪柴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這就是，我選擇的血的歸處。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"火焰吞沒整個峽谷。\n留下的，只有年輕的女妖從小到大書寫的每一句咒文。\n它們忠實地環繞著Logos，是他的盾牌，也是他的利劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"倘若，戰爭是實現理想的唯一方法，新生必須從死亡中來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我會帶來死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也會迎接死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我以血點燃我的過去，不為復仇——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只為來日，這火終會燒盡薩卡茲身上的枷鎖，灼穿整片腐朽的大地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"清脆的骨哨聲響起。\nLogos知道，那不過是，自己在正式前往巴別塔的前夜，於女妖河谷吹響的那一聲骨哨的迴響。\n“新生從滅亡中來。”\n喪鐘鳴響。\n為過去和未來將要腐朽的王庭，更為他自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
